      "note": "Original (2024-2026) Spectre. Legacy price 422,750 looks like MSRP incl. destination; base MSRP was 420,000 (2024) and 397,750 (2025). vehicle_class says 'Luxury Sedan' but it is a two-door coupe. Superseded by Spectre Series II (MY2027, 324 mi EPA, NACS)."
    }
  ],
  "gaps": [
    "Spectre Series II US price not found (Electrek quotes the older 397,750 base); Series II battery size not published.",
